entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=geygBRcnSVkQ7kNvwE0OttE&_nc_oc=AdqElk4HMsHKbCoWhVaavPdrXM1rW9khhXlVZ6yhG3YJE422IvgGQ9InjgzbUGMUevc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRb70R1ROJBTdhc2kZwZPpQBX9L1m6bvegeILznw5_jfw&oe=6B0B1EEF"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5J4UKwcM3qQQ7kNvwGtev7C&_nc_oc=Adr8UTrzrDFjDzzcAYm1wuTkR34Nfmz6Pg3311GCstKnkB-A7K5pezX-UojsPvZ9RBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS0oyI_PeMVyaQkY3GPwDZB7QxGvSS1JUUUJ3eHPOc3CA&oe=6B0B3D6D"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JAniszj1OzoQ7kNvwFcc8a2&_nc_oc=AdpgofGhuqvZGu53GRXbA6sAz6wv2rkcf3SAKOPKj5I0QCWNzGBnial45j6LkaCMpp0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQCUrPjgOXrvVAbeS5J40_84OASLMK2Q_WmmUFuOfel0Q&oe=6B0B3579"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49